# game/Scenes/Update20/u20i.rpy:4
translate italian u20i_8448fa1b:

    # "For now, I should go see Kendra."
    "Per ora, dovrei andare a trovare Kendra."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20i.rpy:7
translate italian u20i_0bb8c7de:

    # "I drive over to Kendra's house and ring the doorbell."
    "Guido fino a casa di Kendra e suono il campanello."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20i.rpy:8
translate italian u20i_4fc89239:

    # "It's late and I hate to wake her, but I need to see her."
    "È tardi e mi dispiace svegliarla, ma ho bisogno di vederla."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20i.rpy:11
translate italian u20i_c67521f3:

    # "Kendra's Mom" "Can I help you?"
    "Kendra's Mom" "Posso aiutarti?"

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20i.rpy:12
translate italian u20i_de2a91d9:

    # pc "Hi, Mrs... uh... I'm sorry I can't remember."
    pc "Salve, signora... ehm... mi dispiace, non ricordo."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20i.rpy:13
translate italian u20i_11072c5d:

    # pc "Can I see Kendra, please?"
    pc "Posso vedere Kendra, per favore?"

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20i.rpy:14
translate italian u20i_00534160:

    # "Kendra's Mom" "Oh, [pcname], is that you? I didn't recognize you. You look awful."
    "Kendra's Mom" "Oh, [pcname], sei tu? Non ti avevo riconosciuta. Hai un aspetto terribile."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20i.rpy:17
translate italian u20i_19dbe255:

    # "Kendra's Mom" "Come in, come in."
    "Kendra's Mom" "Entra, entra."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20i.rpy:18
translate italian u20i_44c98480:

    # "Kendra's Mom" "Kendra has barely left her room in a month, she's been so worried about you."
    "Kendra's Mom" "Kendra non è quasi mai uscita dalla sua stanza in un mese, era così preoccupata per te."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20i.rpy:19
translate italian u20i_63704f39:

    # "Kendra's Mom" "Go ahead and go up. It's the first door on the left."
    "Kendra's Mom" "Sali pure. È la prima porta a sinistra."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20i.rpy:20
translate italian u20i_008e3a26:

    # pc "Thank you."
    pc "Grazie."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20i.rpy:23
translate italian u20i_018f49bc:

    # "I walk quietly up the stairs and into Kendra's room. She's in bed, sleeping."
    "Salgo silenziosamente le scale ed entro nella stanza di Kendra. È a letto, che dorme."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20i.rpy:26
translate italian u20i_cbba5bfa:

    # "Trying not to wake her immediately, I lie next to her and wrap my arms around her."
    "Cercando di non svegliarla subito, mi sdraio accanto a lei e la stringo tra le braccia."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20i.rpy:30
translate italian u20i_c981bd85:

    # "She jolts awake and looks at me, shocked."
    "Si sveglia di soprassalto e mi guarda, scioccata."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20i.rpy:31
translate italian u20i_a0883aa3:

    # sg "[kdaddy]? Is it really you?"
    sg "[kdaddy]? Sei davvero tu?"

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20i.rpy:34
translate italian u20i_0f0952fe:

    # "I don't answer. I just pull her close and kiss her deeply."
    "Non rispondo. La stringo solo a me e la bacio appassionatamente."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20i.rpy:35
translate italian u20i_61fcb071:

    # sg "Oh fuck, I was so worried. I thought you were gone."
    sg "Oh cazzo, ero così preoccupata. Pensavo che te ne fossi andato."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20i.rpy:38
translate italian u20i_3005a5fb:

    # sg "So what happened? Did you see your dad?"
    sg "Allora, cos’è successo? Hai visto tuo padre?"

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20i.rpy:39
translate italian u20i_0118c310:

    # pc "Yeah, I did. I'll tell you all about it tomorrow."
    pc "Sì, l’ho visto. Domani ti racconterò tutto."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20i.rpy:42
translate italian u20i_1cb431e1:

    # sg "I'm just glad you're back!"
    sg "Sono solo felice che tu sia tornato!"

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20i.rpy:43
translate italian u20i_8dd76441:

    # sg "Your hair is so long! We could cut it and glue it to my bald ass!"
    sg "Hai i capelli così lunghi! Potremmo tagliarli e incollarli sulla mia testa calva!"

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20i.rpy:46
translate italian u20i_ca3e5be6:

    # sg "Fuck, I've been crying a lot. I never knew what it would be like to lose somebody you loved."
    sg "Cazzo, ho pianto tantissimo. Non avevo mai immaginato cosa significasse perdere qualcuno che ami."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20i.rpy:47
translate italian u20i_f432b969:

    # "I pull her close and kiss her again, feeling her warmth."
    "La stringo a me e la bacio di nuovo, sentendo il suo calore."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20i.rpy:48
translate italian u20i_20c28e15:

    # sg "I missed you so much, [kdaddy]."
    sg "Mi sei mancata tantissimo, [kdaddy]."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20i.rpy:49
translate italian u20i_14591512:

    # pc "I missed you too, baby."
    pc "Anche tu mi sei mancato, tesoro."

